# Layer 3, business flow "fix42-order-state": the FIX 4.2 order blotter keyed
# by the publisher (tag 13011, the root ClOrdID), published to by the
# fix42-order-state-publisher module. See its docs/02 for the topology.
#
# Nothing here differs from the repo defaults. Unlike fix42-chaining this flow
# loads no module: the publisher resolves the order chain itself, so the
# blotter is a plain SOW topic.
